{"slug":"65360-male-tharisida-gadibidiraaya","title":"ಮಳೆ ತರಿಸಿದ ಗಡಿಬಿಡಿರಾಯ","titleEn":"Male Tharisida Gadibidiraaya","level":"1","description":"","orientation":"landscape","cover":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/65360-male-tharisida-gadibidiraaya/cover.jpg","width":548,"height":545},"audio":null,"provenance":{"source":"https://storyweaver.org.in/en/stories/65360-male-tharisida-gadibidiraaya","license":"CC-BY-4.0","licenseNote":"Fetched from StoryWeaver's public API; the book's own attribution page states 'Released under CC BY 4.0 license' for the story and each illustration. Text is the page HTML with markup removed; illustrations are StoryWeaver's 700–960 px crops, unmodified apart from JPEG re-encoding; audio re-encoded to mono MP3.","storyweaverId":65360,"authors":["Jayanto Banerjee"],"illustrators":["Jayanto Banerjee"],"translators":["M.R.Ganesha Kumar"],"publisher":"Pratham Books","publishedYear":"2019","originalStory":{"title":"Gadbad Das in 'No water for you!'"},"copyrightNotice":"'Male Tharisida Gadibidiraaya' has been published on StoryWeaver by Pratham Books. www.prathambooks.org","attributionLine":"ಮಳೆ ತರಿಸಿದ ಗಡಿಬಿಡಿರಾಯ (Kannada), translated by M.R.Ganesha Kumar, based on original story Gadbad Das in 'No water for you!', written by Jayanto Banerjee, illustrated by Jayanto Banerjee, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2019) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in","imageCredits":[{"page":2,"title":"A donkey worried as no water","illustrator":"Jayanto Banerjee","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":3,"title":"A donkey walking to the tap for water","illustrator":"Jayanto Banerjee","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":4,"title":"A donkey asks for water from an ice- cream vendor","illustrator":"Jayanto Banerjee","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":5,"title":"A vendor shouting at the donkey","illustrator":"Jayanto Banerjee","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":6,"title":"Donkey running behind a water van","illustrator":"Jayanto Banerjee","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":7,"title":"Donkey playing a harmonica","illustrator":"Jayanto Banerjee","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":8,"title":"A donkey sings in the rain!","illustrator":"Jayanto Banerjee","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":9,"title":"Donkey collects water from a drain pipe","illustrator":"Jayanto Banerjee","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":10,"title":"Donkey fixing a bicycle tube","illustrator":"Jayanto Banerjee","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":11,"title":"Donkey playing a harmonium","illustrator":"Jayanto Banerjee","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":12,"title":"Donkey holding a harmonica","illustrator":"Jayanto Banerjee","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":13,"title":"Donkey singing with an harmonium","illustrator":"Jayanto Banerjee","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":14,"title":"Frog running in the rain with a bucket","illustrator":"Jayanto Banerjee","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":17,"title":"A donkey asks for water from an ice- cream vendor","illustrator":"Jayanto Banerjee","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/65360-male-tharisida-gadibidiraaya/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":763},"text":["“ಅಯ್ಯೋ! ನೀರೇ ಇಲ್ಲ! ಸೈಕಲ್ ಟ್ಯೂಬಿನ ಪಂಚರ್ ಹೇಗೆ ನೋಡಲಿ?”"]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/65360-male-tharisida-gadibidiraaya/p02.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["“ನಲ್ಲಿಗಳಲಿ ನೀರೇ ಇಲ್ಲ… ಕೈಪಂಪೂ ಕಾಣುತಿಲ್ಲ.”"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/65360-male-tharisida-gadibidiraaya/p03.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["“ನಿನಗೆ ನೀರು ಕೊಡಲ್ಲ. ಹೋಗು!”"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/65360-male-tharisida-gadibidiraaya/p04.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["“ಕಾಸು ಕೊಟ್ಟು ಕುಡಿಯಪ್ಪ. ಇಲ್ಲಿ ಏನೂ ಪುಕ್ಕಟೆ ಸಿಗಲ್ಲ!”"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/65360-male-tharisida-gadibidiraaya/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["“ಏ, ನೀರಿನ ಟ್ಯಾಂಕೀ, ಒಂದು ಸಲ ನಿಲ್ಲಿಸಪ್ಪ!”"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/65360-male-tharisida-gadibidiraaya/p06.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["“ನನ್ನ ಸಮಯವೇ ಸರಿ ಇಲ್ಲವೆ? ಏನೇ ಆದರೂ, ಹಾಡಿಕೊಂಡು ಖುಷಿಯಾಗಿರು ಅಂದಿದ್ದರು ಅಪ್ಪ…”","“ಹುಯ್ಯೊ, ಹುಯ್ಯೋ ಮಳೆರಾಯ.”"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/65360-male-tharisida-gadibidiraaya/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["“ಲಲಲಲಲಲಲಆಆಆಆಆ!” “ಅಯ್ಯೋ! ಇವನ ಕೆಟ್ಟ ಹಾಡನ್ನು ಕೇಳಲಾರೆ.”","ಕೂಡಲೆ ಮಳೆ ಸುರಿಯಿತು!"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/65360-male-tharisida-gadibidiraaya/p08.jpg","width":639,"height":687},"text":["ಗಡಿಬಿಡಿರಾಯ ನೀರು ಹಿಡಿದುಕೊಂಡ."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/65360-male-tharisida-gadibidiraaya/p09.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಅಂಗಡಿಗೆ ಓಡಿ ಹೋಗಿ ಪಂಚರ್ ಹಾಕಿದ‌."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/65360-male-tharisida-gadibidiraaya/p10.jpg","width":639,"height":687},"text":["“ಭಲೇ, ಭಲೇ ಗಡಿಬಿಡಿರಾಯ! ಅಂತೂ ಮಳೆ ತರಿಸಿಬಿಟ್ಟೆ.”"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/65360-male-tharisida-gadibidiraaya/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["“ದಯವಿಟ್ಟು ನೀರು ಉಳಿಸಿ. ಅಥವಾ ನಿಮ್ಮೆದುರೂ ಒಮ್ಮೆ... ಹಾಡಲೋ?”"]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/65360-male-tharisida-gadibidiraaya/p12.jpg","width":479,"height":686},"text":["ಗಡಿಬಿಡಿರಾಯ!","ಕೆಟ್ಟ ಹಾಡಿಗೆ ಹೆಸರಾದ ಕತ್ತೆರಾಯನ ಮಗನೇ ಗಡಿಬಿಡಿರಾಯ! ಭಾರತದ ಸಣ್ಣ ಊರೊಂದರಲ್ಲಿ ಇದ್ದಾನೆ. ಅಪ್ಪನಂತೆಯೇ ಅವನದೂ ಕೆಟ್ಟ ಧ್ವನಿ. ಅದು ಇಡೀ ಊರಿಗೆ ಗೊತ್ತು - ಗಡಿಬಿಡಿ ಒಬ್ಬನನ್ನು ಬಿಟ್ಟು. ಹೊಟ್ಟೆಪಾಡಿಗಾಗಿ ಸಣ್ಣಪುಟ್ಟ ಕೆಲಸಗಳನ್ನು ಮಾಡುತ್ತಾ, ಕಷ್ಟಗಳಿಗೆ ಹೆದರದೇ ಸದಾ ಹಾಡಿಕೊಂಡು ಕೆಲಸ ಸಾಧಿಸುವವನೇ ಈ ಗಡಿಬಿಡಿರಾಯ ."]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/65360-male-tharisida-gadibidiraaya/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":[]}],"wordCount":109}